"\n"
msgstr ""
"    Seu Ascendente Natal cai em sua CASA %d DO RETORNO SOLAR.\n"
"\n"

#: src/solar_return.c:727
#, c-format
msgid ""
"    Total alignment. Your core identity acts with absolute clarity and "
"autonomy.The year allows you to express your true self without masks or "
"friction.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
