"na sociedade neste ano.\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#: src/solar_return.c:757
#, c-format
msgid ""
"    A year of alliances and aspirations. Your focus is placed on collective "
"projects, friendships, benefactors, and the realization of long-held hopes.\n"
"\n"
